{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a9e97e80-a6e8-8cdd-9ca2-541aff3d1567",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T12:41:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nancy Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I have water coming into my cellar and I want to know who to call to get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:39:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Can I get your address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "368 Chapel Street. Up in the Historic Hill neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "368 Chapel Street. And how much water are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches. It seeped in along the back wall. I've been in this house a lot of years and that has never happened. Not once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And this is from the rain we're having today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the rain that started this morning. It's still coming down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know where the water is coming from? Is it the street, a drain, your gutters?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say for certain. But out front it's running down the side of the property toward my neighbor's garage. It's headed right for the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so water running off toward the neighbor's garage. I'll put in a request for a crew to check the drain and the street in front of 368 Chapel. Is that the right number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "368, yes. And how do I know somebody will actually come? Today, I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:40:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't give you a time, since crews are busy with the rain. But it goes in as a flooding report today, and they work from those. If it gets worse or reaches the garage, call back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is it you I call back, or someone else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This same number, Public Works. Ask for the flooding report at 368 Chapel. Can I have a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:41:13-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:41:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0170. Let me read that back. Zero one seven zero, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. I'd go knock on the neighbor's door, but he still has my ladder. He borrowed it in October and never brought it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, maybe now's a good time to ask for it. I'll get this in right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T12:41:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
